{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/961914-dots-in-arcana-for-npcs","id":961914,"title":"Dots in arcana for NPCS","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-01T14:48:07-07:00","id":961914,"title":"Dots in arcana for NPCS","content":"So sparred on by the Gnosis 10 thread. I've just the last few weeks got into mage and i've read quite a bit but the power-scale and numbers are just of a different world to me then the ones im used to. As well as mages get to bump their own exp more or less at will. (yeah yeah i know it's different and such, i just want more veiws and perspective) How many dots in how many different aracna and what gnosis does your NPCs have? What Arcana and what gnosis level have your Hierarch? the leaders of the caucus? Ruling council ? Sentiels? Herald? Mentors and more?<br /> How does the playfield look?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T21:52:43-07:00","id":962071,"title":"","content":"I started a similar <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/946768-how-common-is-should-be-mastery-of-one-or-multiple-arcana\">thread</a> a little while back that might have some useful information for you. However we got very much off topic so it's probably good to have a new thread about it.<br /> <br /> Personally in my chronicle, I use the starting template from the book as an &quot;average&quot; mage. Mentors, Sentinels, Heralds, etc, (anyone who works professionally in mage circles) I will usually have as at least an adept in their primary Arcana. Each order has at least one person who has mastered each Arcanum, probably with some overlap. People like the Hierarch, Councillors, Provosts or leaders of a particular order are likely to be masters. Apprentices or people who try to lead completely normal lives might have just a couple of dots in the Arcana. <br /> <br /> This isn't a hard and fast rule, but I often assume that anyone has a Gnosis at least as high as their dots in mage status merits all added together.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6748-michael-kenner","name":"Michael Kenner","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6748_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T11:56:45-07:00","id":963822,"title":"","content":"I create my setting more or less as Michael does, with just one difference: I usually don't have as many Masters per Order. Perhaps that rule works fine over a large Caucus, but within a specific Concilium, I think it is more interesting if some Orders lack some Arcana at Master level. In fact, in my cities, every Order usually has only one or two Masters within the Concilium. Other Masters could be fetches from the greater Caucus if really needed, but you have to think twice if you wanna go that route (after all, they are away working in their own Mysteries). This setup also gives the Orders even more reasons to cooperate, and may even give a smaller or weaker Order some important leverage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}